4645-  withdrawing the proceeding without that decision or conclusion is the event ruled out; the proceeding still going on the due
4646-  day is the wait. Such an event always has a ruling out, and an answer that names none, or that writes the authority's
4647-  decision to go on as the ruling out, is at fault. The judged question stays the one the thesis's outcome names.
4648-- **Scope:** the clean path's ladder step; mark R of the readers' form.
