6618-- **Why D543 was reopened the same day:** its consensus left the path's own question (which system carries forward) to Alex.
6619-  His words in D439 give that job to the council ("自行的根据数据和目标做决策 ... 掰扯直到你们能达到共识为止再下去执行 ... 持续迭代完成我们的PRD生产目标";
6620-  D509: "下来你自行按照我的准则操作"), and where it cannot settle a question it takes the cheaper, reversible course; it does not hand
6621-  the question back. Claude had argued the independent reviewer out of a position; that was Claude's error, recorded here.
6622-- **The council** (`docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/reflection-2/cold-challenge-2.md`, `cold-codex-3.md`): the evidence set
6623-  out by Alex's own criteria; Claude's position; the reviewer's decision with two qualifications.
6624-- **Decided, citing D439:** **the work toward production goes on the new system (the rebuild under `clean-arch/`). The old
6625-  system stays the running default until the new one passes its gates; both remain; nothing that runs is switched, deleted or
6626-  deployed by this decision.** It does not establish that the new system's answers are better. Reasons: Alex had reopened work
6627-  on the rebuild (2026-11-06) and D439's scope names its steps; its treatment of the company's financial figures follows the
6628-  product rule he last confirmed (D505); the fresh week gives no demonstrated reason to abandon it and shows fewer trivial or
6629-  duplicate questions in that one run; the old system's known defects sit in frozen pieces whose fixes are each a new version.
6630-- **Qualifications kept:** D505's rule was given for the new system; whether it applies to the old one stays open and is not
6631-  claimed. The rebuild's cost and time to production are unknown: its step that writes answer choices has not met its lines on
6632-  the original or the fresh questions, Stage B did not pass, integration is undone, and several of its pieces are frozen or
6633-  stopped and need their own decisions.
6634-- **What reverses it:** Alex's word (it overrides this at any time); Alex changing the product rule; a sound comparison on the
6635-  subjects both systems track that materially favours the old system; the rebuild failing to meet its unchanged gates within a
6636-  bound agreed later; cost, only after correctness is established and the cost examined.
6637-- **A first checkpoint:** $5 of further spending on this direction; reaching it without a candidate that passes its prewritten
6638-  small test returns the direction to the council (it does not prove the rebuild cannot work).
6639-- **The one next step, $0 of model calls (ceiling $1 for the step):** a bounded review of the new system's answer choices in
--
